# Architecture

Small Fanvue OAuth app + local JSON ops runtime. No surprise Redis, n8n, Telegram, or vector DBs.

## Layout

```
src/env.ts                         # t3 env + zod
src/lib/oauth.ts                   # PKCE, authorize, token exchange
src/lib/session.ts                 # jose JWT cookie
src/lib/fanvue.ts                  # GET /users/me + API version header
src/lib/ops/*                      # phase, guardrails, cooldown, orchestrator, agents
src/app/ops                        # dashboard
src/app/api/ops/{status,tick,actions,state}
src/app/api/oauth/*                # login / callback / logout
src/app/callback                   # registered local Redirect URI: GET /callback on :3456
```

Defaults: `OAUTH_ISSUER_BASE_URL=https://auth.fanvue.com`, `API_BASE_URL=https://api.fanvue.com`.
API version header: `X-Fanvue-API-Version: 2025-06-26`.

System scopes always appended: `openid offline_access offline`. `OAUTH_SCOPES` must match the Fanvue developer app (starter: `read:self`).

## Fanvue calls

Wrap real endpoints only. Skip (do not invent success) when unauthenticated or 401/403:

- `GET /users/me` (`read:self`) — identity + subscriber counts
- `GET /posts` (`read:post`)
- `GET /creators/{uuid}/chats` (`read:chat`)
- `GET /creators/{uuid}/subscribers` (`read:creator` + `read:fan`)
- `GET /creators/{uuid}/insights/subscribers` (`read:insights`)

Do not POST messages or posts in Phase 0/1. Guardrails refuse it.

## Ops state

`.data/ops-state.json` (gitignored). Fine for local/Cloud Agent. Vercel cron without a disk is best-effort; do not add a database until Phase 3+ and the 24-hour rule still holds.

## Secrets

Never commit `.env.local`. Never print access tokens in UI. Homepage JSON is `/users/me` profile data only.

## Tests / verification

`pnpm test`, `pnpm lint`, `pnpm build`. Hit `/`, `/ops`, `/api/ops/status`. Login redirects to `auth.fanvue.com`. Do not claim Fanvue login works until the user registers the redirect URI and clicks Login.
